: "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75254872_427799913347660_1009234490175775686_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T-gfLGOEL4QQ7kNvwG64w4q&_nc_oc=AdoNHjpnQtT11ipskvxVIB_VURNvO2DAVJuMgQXTsXPYYvxB-GO0_f8W6MvOt73LRlc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRWIhxIpZCT5kv1jM2PeHbWlv-goVFRHvIdh-bPYHxFWQ&oe=6AFC5F0F"}, "display_name": "Hamster Inc.", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to \"Hamster Inc.\"! It's a physics building game that supports \"mixed reality\". In this delightful puzzle game, you'll design, build, and then program machines to overcome challenges!\n\n# Creativity and Logic\n- Based on physical principles and logic, think about how to overcome obstacles and help hamsters improve transportation efficiency.\n{1557136708179895}\n\n# Assembling\n- Design and build a variety of machines with over 60 types of blocks.\n- Over 20 special-function blocks that can be programmed, such as ultrasonic sensors, DC motors, radars and more.\n{327773876776917}\n\n# Graphical programming\n- Super easy! Graphical programming makes your creations \"alive\"!\n{406792278927140}\n\n# Explore 6 unique themes\n- Explore Eastern Forests, Automated factories, Sunshine Coast, Western Gobi, Volcanic Tunnels, and Northern snowfields.\n- As you progress, develop your hamster company and unlock new resources and challenges.\n\n# Enjoy the sandbox mode\n- where you can build and program freely without any limitations on the block amount!\n{971212150879070}\n\n# Mixed Reality\nBring your creations into real world and transform the entire room into a dream paradise: \n- Create custom levels by using real furniture and virtual terrain models, \n- Have your car/drone automatically avoid furniture as it moves around the room,\n- Watch virtual creatures interact with real world: like bison running on tables, floors, or beds!\n{897586709048914}\n\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/NkC8bwQEmK\n", "short_description": "\"Hamster Inc.\" is a physics-based building game that supports \"mixed reality.\"\nIn the game, you can build a variety of interesting inventions such as trebuchets, unmanned trucks, robotic arms, and drones to help the hamsters overcome challenges one after another and continuously develop and expand the logistics territory."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u6d77\u62a52560x1440\u5907\u90097-2+logo-\u4e2d\u6587.png", "id": "3772762123041281", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65229464_3772762126374614_5116127187365598796_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vhZSjVU6EYcQ7kNvwEppkOJ&_nc_oc=AdoBYzxgnR-2ga6YvMIToId8Aik1r_vOJ37hPRdlMcKnS25jG2LB-8_TzJMMVtEBa0s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQNJyJmYupYEHszTc3VpLY292BHYy6EajrDTHjt8Eer1Q&oe=6AFC9399"}, {"file_name": "icon2.png", "id": "1090290192036087", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575357_1090290195369420_677972531973123807_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VP9dJlPHOLIQ7kNvwEoejcM&_nc_oc=AdpmT_d6i4N64qbi3G7HY9KgUY02b9vtfM2o9Kf4ga_KLcOMDkzSTw59_EC2gs5vjuY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSMXydj0fPGFeOBbBTSmvvu9mtWKGqw6FkBvcmpQrJkwQ&oe=6AFC7C0D"}, {"file_name": "hamster inc._logo_ch.png", "id": "857711756373822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476756_857711759707155_7542117578876813577_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pn5ZnJeq6BcQ7kNvwEwW0_H&_nc_oc=Adrt28ljotMZXad6jnACCdRLEZaAQLTq2tBraiByfoLYkr3e5tLA05iz8Tr5affJPN8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT6EjgKXrdxSgOpBj1Ne5rd5KnaleCr0JVg4FGXvsyEdA&oe=6AFC7E95"}, {"file_name": "\u6d77\u62a53000x900\u5907\u90094-2+logo-\u4e2d\u6587.png", "id